hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1329","We are Muhammad bin Yahya, we are Abdul Razzaq, Ibn Jurayj told us, Abu Al-Zubayr told me, that he heard Jabir bin Abdullah, saying in God Almighty says: “Indeed, the polytheists are unclean, so do not approach the Sacred Mosque after this year of theirs.” Surat Al-Tawbah, Verse 28. He said: “Unless he is a slave or “One of the people of Dhimmah.”"
